---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms & Conditions - VideoCompressOnline" 
	description="Terms and Conditions for using VideoCompressOnline."
>
	<Header tone="light" />

	<section class="band-light w-full border-b border-[var(--color-hairline)]">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 pt-16 pb-10 md:pt-24 md:pb-12">
			<p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
			<h1 class="display-large text-[var(--color-ink)]">Terms & Conditions</h1>
		</div>
	</section>

	<main class="band-light flex-grow w-full">
	<div class="doc max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
		
		<div>
			<p><strong>Last Updated: June 2026</strong></p>
			
			<p>By accessing and using VideoCompressOnline (the "Website"), you agree to be bound by the following terms and conditions.</p>
			
			<h2>1. Use of the Service</h2>
			<p>VideoCompressOnline provides a client-side video compression tool. You are permitted to use this service for both personal and commercial purposes, provided you do not use it for illegal activities or to compress illicit materials.</p>
			
			<h2>2. Local Processing and Data Responsibility</h2>
			<p>All video processing occurs locally on your device within your web browser. We do not upload, store, or have access to the video files you process. You are solely responsible for ensuring you have backups of your original files, as video compression is a lossy process that alters the original data.</p>
			
			<h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
			<p>You retain all intellectual property rights to the videos you process using our tool. We claim no ownership over your content.</p>
			
			<h2>4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
			<p>The service is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. While we strive to provide high-quality compression, we do not guarantee that the service will meet your specific requirements, be error-free, or be available at all times. The heavy processing required for video compression may cause high CPU usage on your device.</p>
			
			<h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
			<p>In no event shall VideoCompressOnline or its creators be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the service, including but not limited to loss of data or damage to your device from high resource usage.</p>
			
			<h2>6. Changes to Terms</h2>
			<p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the website after any such changes constitutes your consent to the modifications.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</Layout>
